blic","site_admin":false},"body":"Approach is right — backfills the data [#3197](https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3197) and [#3199](https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3199) explicitly left out. `WHERE expiry IS NOT NULL AND expiry < '1900-01-01'` is robust on both SQLite (lex compare, `'0' < '1'`) and Postgres (implicit timestamp cast). Test covers the five interesting expiry states.\n\nTwo small nits to fix before merge:\n\n1. Drop the `#3197` / `#3199` refs and the `Fixes:` URL from the source comment in `hscontrol/db/db.go`. Those belong in the commit message and `CHANGELOG.md`, not next to the SQL. The prose (\"versions before 0.28 persisted a pointer to a zero `time.Time`…\") stands on its own.\n\n2. Repo uses Go-style `package: imperative` for titles, not Conventional Commits — recent log has `db: scope DestroyUser …`, `state: fix policy change race …`. Suggest renaming to `db: backfill zero-time node expiry to NULL`.","commit_id":"0d627f2d26c12e1a195e200b85e285a039f64c2c","state":"changes_requested","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3285#pullrequestreview-4363150411","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3285","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3285#pullrequestreview-4363150411"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3285"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-26T11:04:51Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T11:04:51Z","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","event":"reviewed"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4545715171","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3285#issuecomment-4545715171","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3285","id":4545715171,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABDvIb4w","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gith